fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266SubPicLevelInfo","fragment":"\n\tGstH266SubPicLevelInfo\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266SubPicLevelInfo\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266SubPicLevelInfo\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 subpicture level information.\nspecifies the number of reference levels signalled\nfor each subpicture sequences.\nspecifies whether to decode the sub-bitstreams\nresulting from extraction of any subpicture sequence.\nspecifies whether the syntax elements\nsli_ref_level_fraction_minus1[ i ] are present.\nspecifies the number of subpictures in the pictures in\nthe multiSubpicLayers in targetCvss.\nspecifies the maximum number of temporal sublayers in\nthe subpicture sequences.\nspecifies whether the level information for\nsubpicture sequences is present for sublayer representation.\nindicates the i-th fraction of the bitstream\nlevel limits associated with layers in targetCvss.\nindicates the i-th level to which each subpicture sequence\nconforms as specified in Annex A.\nspecifies the i-th fraction of the level limits\nfor the subpictures.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 subpicture level information.\nspecifies the number of reference levels signalled\nfor each subpicture sequences.\nspecifies whether to decode the sub-bitstreams\nresulting from extraction of any subpicture sequence.\nspecifies whether the syntax elements\nsli_ref_level_fraction_minus1[ i ] are present.\nspecifies the number of subpictures in the pictures in\nthe multiSubpicLayers in targetCvss.\nspecifies the maximum number of temporal sublayers in\nthe subpicture sequences.\nspecifies whether the level information for\nsubpicture sequences is present for sublayer representation.\nindicates the i-th fraction of the bitstream\nlevel limits associated with layers in targetCvss.\nindicates the i-th level to which each subpicture sequence\nconforms as specified in Annex A.\nspecifies the i-th fraction of the level limits\nfor the subpictures.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 subpicture level information.\nspecifies the number of reference levels signalled\nfor each subpicture sequences.\nspecifies whether to decode the sub-bitstreams\nresulting from extraction of any subpicture sequence.\nspecifies whether the syntax elements\nsli_ref_level_fraction_minus1[ i ] are present.\nspecifies the number of subpictures in the pictures in\nthe multiSubpicLayers in targetCvss.\nspecifies the maximum number of temporal sublayers in\nthe subpicture sequences.\nspecifies whether the level information for\nsubpicture sequences is present for sublayer representation.\nindicates the i-th fraction of the bitstream\nlevel limits associated with layers in targetCvss.\nindicates the i-th level to which each subpicture sequence\nconforms as specified in Annex A.\nspecifies the i-th fraction of the level limits\nfor the subpictures.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});